Package: kde-style-oxygen-qt5
Architecture: any
Breaks: plasma-desktop-data (<< 4:5.20),
Replaces: plasma-desktop-data (<< 4:5.20),
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Qt 5 decoration for the Oxygen desktop theme
 The Oxygen desktop theme is used by Plasma and other KDE Software.
 .
 This package contains the Qt 5 widget theme.

Package: liboxygenstyle5-6
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Multi-Arch: same
Description: style library for the Oxygen desktop theme (Qt 5)
 The Oxygen desktop theme is used by Plasma and other KDE Software.
 .
 This package contains the private library used by the widget theme
 and KWin style.

Package: liboxygenstyleconfig5-6
